## Frequently asked questions

**How long does SEO take?**

Local SEO typically shows meaningful results within 3–6 months, though many clients see improvements within the first 4–8 weeks.

**How much does SEO cost?**

Local SEO campaigns start from around £200–£350/month depending on the scope and competition in your area. [Get in touch](/contact/) for a free consultation and quote.

**Do I need a new website first?**

Not always — we can improve SEO on your existing site. But a well-built [website](/web-design-merthyr-tydfil/) makes a significant difference to how well your SEO performs.

**Can you guarantee rankings?**

No ethical SEO agency can guarantee specific rankings. We can guarantee we'll do the right things to improve them consistently and report transparently on progress.

